window.products.push({"id":279183,"name":"Silicone Clip-on Strainer Colander, DanziX Hands-Free Heat Resistant Drainer Filter for Pot Bowl Pan Pasta Spaghetti Vegetable, with 2 Silicone Gloves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613NZiN5HmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY: Both strainer and gloves are made of the premium quality silicone material. EXCELLENT DESIGN:This strainer helps to free your hands so that you can hold on to the handles of the pan for better control. EASE OF USE: Easily attach strainer to pot with two sturdy clips. This strainer will keep the food in the pot throughout the straining process, eliminating the hassle of transferring food between strainer and pot. EASY TO CLEAN: You can simply rinse with warm water and soap, or just put it in a dishwasher. HEAT RESISTANTMITTS: Our silicone pot gloves can with stand high temperature up to 450° F. It offers you secure and comfortable grip when handling hot cookware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613NZiN5HmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DanziX","source_asin":"B07MCBYGYV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MCBYGYV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MCBYGYV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":279184,"name":"Electric Can Opener, Sokos 3in1 can opener with Knife Sharpener and Bottle Opener, Smooth Edge Heavy Duty Can Opener! Chef's Best Choice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Fj2sRKkrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"1: Recessed blade This automatic can opener features a sharp blade that is safely recessed within the unit. This safety feature helps prevent accidental cuts to your fingers when searching for the tool in your kitchen drawers. 2: Metal gear Using a can opener couldn’t be simpler with the straightforward design of the BangRui Automatic Can Opener. To open a can, position the rim of the can in between the blade and the metal gear. The metal gear guides the rim of the can through the can opener so it moves in a full 360° circle by itself. 3: Battery compartment The new Bangrui can opener is completely different from the original design in appearance. Moreover, it is designed with a plastic sheet in the battery cartridge, which further stabilizes the batteries installed. 4: On/off switch The simple one-touch button couldn’t be easier to operate. Simply press down to begin cutting the can, then press again at any time to stop the action. 5: Magnet When you lift the can opener off the can, the magnet on the BangRui Automatic Can Opener will also pick up the lid. There’s no need to fish into the can with your fingers! It is more hygienic and safe than traditional can openers because the strong magnet does all the work. 6: Insert 2AA batteries in the right poles The battery groove is marked with signs of positive and negative electrodes respectively. While installing the four dry batteries, users should do as indicated by the signs. Once installation is done, cover the battery and the product is ready for use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Fj2sRKkrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sokos","source_asin":"B07529TDVX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07529TDVX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07529TDVX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
