window.products.push({"id":279189,"name":"VEVOR Horizontal Liquid Filling Machine 100-1000ml, Pneumatic Liquid Filling Double Heads, Automatic Bottle Filler for High Viscosity Liquid and Paste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":728.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ygCblckaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Accurate Pneumatic Filling: Our liquid filling machine is equipped with an excellent air cylinder, ensuring the precision of filling, Filling accuracy:≤±1%. In order to meet your various filling needs, adjustable speed and volume are necessary for this machine. Filling volume: 3.4-33.8 oz/100-1000 ml; Filling speed: 0-80 bottles/min. Auto & Manual Control: Two control modes help you operate the machine efficiently. Pedal once and discharge once in manual mode while filling continuously in auto mode. With the advanced air pressure gauge, you can observe the pressure changes at any time and stop the machine if something goes wrong. Stainless Steel Structure: Pneumatic filling machine is made of 304 stainless steel food-grade materials, which can endure corrosion, rust, acid, and alkali. The anti-drip nozzle is designed to avoid leakage and save more liquid during operation. Well-Designed Details: Pneumatic filling with a delicate filling device, including conveying pipe and non-return valve. The soft valve has an excellent non-return effect; make sure the liquid can be transferred to the pipe without blocking and filling successfully in the end. Extensive Uses: This lip gloss filler machine is widely used in pharmaceutical, cosmetic, food, pesticides, and particular industries and is suitable for low-viscosity fluid and liquid filling. This product needs to work with an air compressor(not offered). Therefore, you need to prepare it in advance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ygCblckaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVOR","source_asin":"B08XB6HK42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XB6HK42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XB6HK42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
