window.products.push({"id":279197,"name":"Natural Sheepskin Rug with Thick and Lush 2.5 Inch Pile | Hypoallergenic Sheep Fur Rug with Anti-Skid Back l Sheepskin Wool Area Rugs, Natural, 5 ft x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rr21rXHVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NATURAL THICK FUR AREA RUGS: Cushion your feet and luxuriate in the feel of lush fur with this small sheepskin area rug by Natural. Set this quality fur rug by your bed, in front of your fireplace, near your entryway, or at the foot of a comfy armchair for extra comfort. 100% REAL SHEEPSKIN WOOL PELT: Our craftsmen handpick each sheepskin pelt, choosing the ones with a natural luster and fluffy texture. These 100% authentic sheepskins come from New Zealand sheep farms for a sustainable and natural rug. GENUINE LEATHER BACKING: These sheepskin fur rugs have a micro suede leather backing that features an anti-slip design. Indulge in a fur rug that is hypoallergenic and processed in a way that keeps it from shedding for fluffy, worry-free comfort. TIMELESS QUALITY AND DESIGN: Loom knotted and fade-resistant, these sheepskin rugs last a long time and have a classic design that makes a luxurious statement in any home or office. Mix and match colors to suit your decor with a variety of beautifully dyed sheepskin options. CARE AND CLEANING INSTRUCTIONS: When using for the first time, take outside and give a thorough shake to air out and fluff. As the color may bleed in water, we recommend professional dry cleaning to maintain the softest quality of this sheepskin fur rug.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rr21rXHVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Natural Design Architecture Lifestyle N","source_asin":"B01I5D5PQ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279197","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I5D5PQ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I5D5PQ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
