window.products.push({"id":279282,"name":"T-Bar Portable Bar Set – Floating Bar Perfect for Beach, BBQ, and Pool Party – Folding Serving Tray with Legs and Carrying Case (Yellow)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Cunx8D3DL._AC_.jpg","description":"Here, There, and Everywhere! Going out for drinks with friends can be fun, but it can also be stressful! Long lines, overpriced drinks, and crowded bars lead many people to wish they had just stayed home. But with the T-Bar portable outdoor bar table you can have the best of both worlds! Our folding table bar is the perfect accessory for entertaining friends and family, since it allows you to enjoy your drinks and food from virtually anywhere! The Only Bar You’ll Ever Need! When designing our portable travel bar, we knew we wanted something versatile that could meet a variety of our customers’ needs. Through countless hours of research and hard work, the T-Bar portable bar was born. Sporting features like multi-sized cup holders, removable legs, and floating capabilities; our bar is truly one for any and every occasion. Whether you’re camping, barbecuing, or celebrating your favorite holiday, our serving tray set will provide the space and organization to allow for clean and easy access to your food and drinks. Welcome Home! You’re sure to find endless uses for your handy floating bar table, and in no time you’ll be wondering how you ever lived without a T-Bar. So don’t just keep all of the fun to yourself—share it with friends and family, too! Our portable outside bar is the perfect wedding, housewarming, and birthday gift for anyone that likes to have a good time. They’ll love being able to spend an afternoon at the beach or pool, while still enjoying some cold drinks and snacks. Plus, they’ll be blown away by all of the ways they can use it around the house! Shop Easy, Rest Easy. Not only is ordering our portable folding bar extremely easy, so is returning it! Look, we know that sometimes things don’t work out. And that’s okay! Just contact us, and we’ll either replace your T-Bar or give you a full refund. Start enjoying the good life and add a T-Bar to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Cunx8D3DL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"T-Bar","source_asin":"B07BGCD1CS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BGCD1CS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BGCD1CS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":279283,"name":"Zulay 3 Pack Absorbent Kitchen Towels Cotton - 15 x 25 Inch Super Soft Dish Towels for Kitchen - Reusable Kitchen Dish Cloths for Washing Dishes, Hous","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-y3lygCIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you are someone who does not want to waste paper towels, these hand towels for kitchen are just the right kitchen accessory for you! From drying kitchen countertops, glasses, plates, and flatware to cleaning furniture, this kitchen towel set does it all. Our terry towels for cleaning are great for quickly and effectively absorbing any water or oil spills, or for simply drying your kitchen items. Not only does it do the job, but the 100% thick, high-quality premium cotton is long-lasting and durable for many uses without wearing off. Wash these kitchen hand towels in a machine on a low setting and tumble dry them to get rid of all the dirt and use it for as long as you want. These cotton dish towels for kitchen come in a variety of colors to match your kitchen and home aesthetics. These thirsty dishcloth towels are a must-have while working in the kitchen; use them for wiping your fingers while cooking, drying pans or serving dishes, or patting dry fruits and veggies. Our reusable towels for kitchen make perfect Valentines day gifts, kitchen gifts, Christmas gifts, housewarming gifts, birthday gifts, etc. These dish cloths for washing dishes can be used as kitchen hand towels, rags for cleaning geometry towels, or dish towels for drying dishes. Use these as valentines kitchen towels, kitchen towels decorative set, or place these on your counter for valentines day kitchen decor or everyday kitchen decorations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-y3lygCIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B09YZW2NR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YZW2NR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YZW2NR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":279284,"name":"StickerPirate Warning Area Patrolled by Basset Hound 8\"X12\" Novelty Dog Sign","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J3Ro7Cg8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"8” x 12\" Novelty signs sure to bring a smile. Signs are digitally printed on heavy 040 Aluminum using high quality UV resistant inks. These signs are suitable for indoor or outdoor use. Include rounded corners and holes for mounting. 100% satisfaction guaranteed. If you have a problem let us know and we will make it right or refund your money.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J3Ro7Cg8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"StickerPirate","source_asin":"B00Y71U31Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y71U31Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y71U31Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":279285,"name":"Cookrite Digital Cooking Thermometer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qZInCo8UL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Cookrite instant read digital cooking thermometer allows you to prepare perfectly cooked meals without creating unwanted knife cuts in your beautiful meal! The Cookrite thermometer features an extensive temperature range in both Celcius and Farenheit going from -58ºF to 572ºF or -50ºC to 300ºC. With an easy to read LCD display, it also has an auto shut off to prevent unwanted dead batteries. A top performing battery is included in your purchase. It also comes with a reliable storage case convenient for any kitchen or BBQ. Use it on meats, fish, casseroles, re-heated foods, breads, cakes, deep frying and candy. Cookrite thermometers are crafted with the finest quality and materials. If you're cooking, Cookrite.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qZInCo8UL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cook-Rite","source_asin":"B00U5QZLSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00U5QZLSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00U5QZLSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
