window.products.push({"id":279362,"name":"FeelAtHome 100% Cotton Pillow Protector with Zipper Waterproof Covers-20 x 26 Inches (Pack of 4, Standard) - Noiseless Pillowcase Encasement - Zippere","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HlPkMOvYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton 😌 LUXURIOUS COTTON SATEEN MATERIAL - Sleep tight and sleep soundly at night with FeelAtHome’s luxury 100% cotton sateen pillow protector! The luxurious 100% cotton sateen material is noiseless and very comfortable for the ultimate night's rest 🤫 COOLING, NOISELESS FABRIC - Made of a cooling, noiseless fabric material, the bed pillow liners ensure that you have a comfortable deep rest after a long tiring day. Comes in all pillow case sizes of Standard, Queen, King and Body Pillow 🌊 ❌WATERPROOF PROTECTION - Full waterproof protective coverage. Sometimes there are accidental spills from water, wine or other beverages. Keep your pillow away from such liquid spills, stains and body perspiration all year round! 🤐 ZIPPERED PROTECTION - The pillowcase protector european has a zipper for full sized, secured coverage and closure of your pillow. This form of pillow encasement keeps out stuff like dirt and strands of hair from your pillow 🧺 MACHINE WASHABLE, 100% SATISFACTION GAURANTEED - FeelAtHome’s pillow protector square is machine washable and suitable for babies and adults alike. If ever you are not satisfied with it, we offer a 100% money-back guarantee!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HlPkMOvYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FeelAtHome","source_asin":"B098TH9D3R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098TH9D3R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098TH9D3R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":279363,"name":"Esanvil Silicone Baking Mat for Oven Non-Stick Free BPA Food Safe Baking Sheets for Macaron/Pastry/Cookie/Pizza/Bun/Bread Making（2 Piece-Set）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810g9H9r46S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"FOOD SAFE/NON-TOXIC & HEALTHY: Made of premium quality US FDA and European LFGB food-grade silicone and fiberglass. The 100% non-toxic platinum silica gel passed strict food safety tests. Heat-Resistant, safe from bitter cold to intense heat (-40°F up to 480°F). Naturally nonstick mat reduces intake of cholesterol, saturated fat & cancerogenic substances produced by cooking oils subjected to high temperatures. NON-STICK & EASY-TO-CLEAN: No more scrubbing! Even burnt sugar and fat falls off on its on. Just rinse the mat in warm soapy water to clean it. You can also wash it in your dishwasher. Repeated multiple uses and washing cycles do not affect non-stick properties of the mat. After every use and cleanup, it will be just like new again. SIZE & MULTI-PURPOSE: 2pcs 15.8\" x 11.8\" silicone mat fits US standard half size baking sheets. Perfect for baking, kneading, rolling,candy/macaron/pastry/cookie/bun/bread making as well as for freezing meat balls, dumplings, fruits and vegetables. Best in class quality, Reusable over 2000 times! OVEN SAFE: Uniquely designed for use in most ovens, these professional-grade baking mats can be used with oven tray pans or cookie sheets to improve overall heat distribution and air circulation for even and consistent results, without burned or undercooked spots. The Baking Mat can eliminat the need for butter, oil, unhealthy sprays or the waste of using parchment paper and foil to cover your baking and cooking surface. PROFESSIONAL BAKING: If you have been without a silicone baking mat, you have been missing out! These heavenly, food-safe silicone baking mats are perfect for the seasoned pastry chef, at home baking enthusiast, or novice just getting started. Turn any quarter sheet cookie tray into a non-stick surface for healthy and convenient every day baking and cooking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810g9H9r46S._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Esanvil","source_asin":"B08BCPMQ2Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BCPMQ2Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BCPMQ2Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
