window.products.push({"id":279370,"name":"KGSPK Beauty and The Beast Anti Fatigue Kitchen Mat Comfort Floor Mats Non-Slip Oil Stain Resistant Easy to Clean Kitchen Rug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dwz-BFTpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The kitchen mat made by us is well known for its high quality, excellent design and exclamatory craft. We regard continuous innovation and produce high quality carpet as the highest goal. Modern kitchen rug mat are suitable for hard floor provide protection and cushioning for floor. Believe KGSPK, we will give you 100% satisfaction. SPECIFICATION: 1.Material: Thick polyester, non-woven fabric and PVC granular bottom 2.Size:17.7x47.2 inches 3.Package included:1 x modern kitchen rug mat 4.Style:Modern/fashion/unique/interesting/individuation FEATURE: 1.This kitchen rug is water absorption and oil stain resistant, keep your kitchen dry ans moisture. 2.Slip resistant: it can ensure you have a safe activity and non-skid backing keeps the rug in place and protects the floor. 3.Durable and stylish, sturdy edge stitching keep the rug mat in original good condition after multiple machine wash and longtime use. Fashion pattern design upgrade home and kitchen decor. 4.Soft mats suitable for indoor/outdoor door mats, kitchen, bathroom, bedroom, living room, dining room, office, porch, stairs, balcony, kid's room etc. Can our rug machine wash and machine spin dry? Yes, you can directly throw our rug into the washing machine and let it air dry after you settle it flat.What’s more, the rug’s color will not fade with continual uses. Note: 1. Please kindly allow 1-2cm discrepancy. 2. To be convenient for transporting the slip are folded,which means, crease may exist when you received. The crease will disappear if you place it for 3-5 hours. 3. Pictures are taken by pro photographer, please understand the differences caused by lighting effects and monitor's brightness/contrast settings etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dwz-BFTpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KGSPK","source_asin":"B08MDYKSSR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279370","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MDYKSSR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MDYKSSR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":279371,"name":"WEXFORD HOME Landscape Canvas Wall Art Abstract Floral Forest Modern Pictures Artwork Decoration for Living Room Kitchen Bathroom Office, Ready to Han","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KNFJxCD0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Beautiful Landscape Art: We have some fantastic images for sale and this one is no exception.This print would fit with any number of decor styles, from western, traditional, rustic, cabin, country, antique, vintage, and more. Add some color to your walls with this or one of our other great prints. Brighten up your Space: We have a huge variety of images and sizes for you to choose from to help transform your space, no matter your style. Choose something that will fit your specific aesthetic. Paintings and decorations are a great way to express yourself and easily compliment or establish a theme for any room. Made to Order: Each print is made to order and made in America. Your print will be Giclée printed on canvas, professionally hand-stretched, and will arrive ready to hang. Each order comes with a picture hanging kit that can be quickly assembled so your new artwork can be promptly displayed. Our canvas prints are UV resistant, fade resistant, and water resistant. Easily dust clean dry dust with a feather duster or a soft, dry cloth if needed. Range of Sizes and Themes: If it can fit in a frame it can go on your wall. We have an ever-growing catalog of artwork for you to choose from and offer a variety of sizes to fit your exact space. From large to small and options in between. We offer a nice selection of sizes. Whether you are looking for a new piece to greet you at your entryway, to proudly display in your office, or to adorn your bedroom wall, we have just the print for you. A Perfect Gift: Treat yourself or someone you care for. Artwork is a great gift idea for holidays, birthdays, anniversaries, graduations, or just because. Give a gift that will be a reminder of you. Art can be placed anywhere no matter the size of the home, apartment, dorm, or office and can be displayed in just as many places, from the kitchen, to a bathroom, living room, hallway, and more. Decorate a wall with something worth looking at.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KNFJxCD0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WEXFORD HOME","source_asin":"B08SGW848F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SGW848F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SGW848F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
