window.products.push({"id":279422,"name":"Sugar Bowls with Lids and Spoon Integrated - Label Included, Salt Pepper Bowls for Countertop, Sugar Dispenser Salt Container, Glass Seasoning Contain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mbg32djKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Lid Spoon Integrated]: We made a better design, the lid of sugar bowl is integrated with spoon. Open the lid, get the spoon! You can handle the seasoning while cooking with one hand. Newly upgraded concave spoon, streamlined design of the spoon head, easy to insert a full bottle of seasoning, long-term use to prevent the bottom of the spoon residue seasoning. [Precise Control of Usage]: With our spice jar, you can precisely control the amount of seasoning used in cooking to create delicious dishes. The spice jar is equipped with a scraper at the mouth of the jar, so you can control the amount of spices precisely with the scraper, 1 flat spoon = 1 gram. [Silicone Seal against Moisture]: The moisture-proof silicone seal is located in the lid, and the silicone seal ensures that your spices can be kept in the kitchen for a long time without getting clumped and spoiled by moisture. [Label Included]: The seasoning jar is designed with a sticker area at the handle, so you can use the stickers we included with the package to differentiate the different seasonings. This will make your kitchen tidier and less cluttered, and the cooking process will be more convenient. [Soda Glass & Premium Plastic]: The main body of the seasoning jar is made of soda lime glass, which is hard enough for kitchen use and not easy to smash. The lid and spoon are made of food-grade PP plastic to ensure food safety. A seasoning jar can hold 250 grams of solid seasoning, enough to meet daily needs. It needs to be washed and dried with detergent before use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mbg32djKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAPMOOD","source_asin":"B09JZ6GSWB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JZ6GSWB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JZ6GSWB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
