window.products.push({"id":279454,"name":"BPA Free Silicone Cake Pop Mold, Lollipop Silicone Molds,Muffin Cake Ice Cube Trays 120 Sticks Gumdrop Jelly Moulds- Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kMRhPL6tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Bpa Free & Reusable】Cake pop mold made of 100% pure food-grade silicone, BPA Free and tasteless. With super toughness, the lollipop mould with 20 balls are reusable and hard to deform. Heat resistant: -40℉to 446℉(0°C - 230°C)). Safe for use in the oven, dishwasher, freezer, refrigerator and microwave. 【Flexible & Non-Stick】 The silicone cake pop molds is more convenient to use than the traditional one. It's soft and flexible, the food won't easily crack when you take them out. In addition, due to the non-stick characteristics, these muffin candy molds are easy to clean and dry, which is also dishwasher safe. 【Easy To Use & Unbreakable】The silicone lollipop molds are very easy to fill, just assemble the mold and pour liquid from the small hole, even little kids can easily make candy or chocolate, perfect for DIY with the whole family; Don't worry if you accidentally hit, bump, or drop these candy making supplies, they are not broken, which allows you to use them for a long time without having to run for a replacement. 【Widely Uses】 With lovely shapes of ball, you can make lollipop, cake pop mufins, chocolate, candy, gumdrop, jelly, ice cube ,desserts, fat bombs ,hard candy etc. You also can add extra vitamin C to help achieve health benefits. Take these chocolate candy molds and create more sweet candy to share with your family, friends or partners. 【After-Sales Service】 We test and improve our Ball Shaped Mold constantly to provide you the best quality at the most favorable price possible. if you are not satisfied or have any questions with our mufin cake molds, please feel free to contact us, we are ready to solve all problem for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kMRhPL6tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Junxave","source_asin":"B085WPCVM3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085WPCVM3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085WPCVM3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":279455,"name":"KASENTEX All Season Luxury Premium White Goose Down Comforter with Contemporary Black Piped Edge, 100% Cotton Fabric, 47oz, 750 Fill Power, Duvet Inse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d3wVtYPQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💛 KING SIZE: 104x90 inches all season premium goose down comforter and provides amazing warmth all year round. 💛 PREMIUM SOFTNESS: The most comfortable goose down comforter, keeping you warm and cozy at night. The layer of insulation underneath feathers will enhance the comfortability with the heat absorption while you sleep, making any uncomfortable sleep a relaxing one. 💛 LUXURIOUSLY SOFT AND FLUFFY – Sleep like you’re on cloud 9 with 30oz of fill surrounded by ultra-soft, breathable 100% cotton exterior. Our comforter, with its 750 fill power, will surround you in cloud-like comfort and bring a sleeping experience like no other. Enjoy the timeless comfort and natural style of this goose down comforter and a well-chosen duvet insert for warm and cozy night's sleep. OEKO-TEX Standard 100 💛 BAFFLE BOX DESIGN – The unique 3D design includes premium goose down filling, 8 duvet loops and a deluxe black pipped edge. The beautiful three-dimensional fabric stitched boxes allow maximum thickness and comfort while maintaining even fill distribution. This unique construction minimizes migration of fill so the down doesn't shift or clump in one section. 💛 PERFECT GIFT – Give the gift of a better night’s sleep. This high-quality, high-luxury comforter, with it’s beautiful design, is crafted with thought and care. Our vacuum sealed packaging makes it perfect for the holidays and all special occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d3wVtYPQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KASENTEX","source_asin":"B08J5VN2RR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J5VN2RR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J5VN2RR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":279456,"name":"CHITA King Size Premium Cool Gel Memory Foam Mattress, 14 Inch Medium Firm Mattress-5 Layers of Comfort- Cooling Cover Mattress in a Box- CertiPUR-US ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91amsTY9P+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【FIVE LAYERS OF COMFORT】 (1) Top layer of Ice cooling fabric mattress cover; (2) 3\" Gel memory foam and ice cooling cover collaborate to add breathability and coolness; (3) 3\" Transition layer to support your weight and avoid subsidence;(4)8\" Basic layer to strengthen support;(5)Mattress cover to ensure that the mattress will not slip! All foam layers are CertiPUR-US certified for your safety. 【3\" GEL-INFUSED MEMORY FOAM】The 3\" thick gel layer is thicker than ordinary mattresses. Cooling memory foam and ice cooling cover collaborate to add breathability and coolness 【FIBERGLASS FREE】Our Fiberglass Free FR inner sock replaces traditional fireproof materials that contain fiberglass. The health of customers is always the first priority, and we use higher costs to care for the health of customers. 【ICE COOLING FABRIC COVER】Cooling Fabric Exclusive at CHITA – Unlike the so-called breathable cover (usually made of 100% of polyester) commonly used in the mattress industry, 45% of our mattress cover is composed of cooling particles.The surface is smooth and breathable. 【MATTRESS IN A BOX】Mattress ships compressed, rolled, and shipped in a box conveniently delivered to your door for easy set-up. Simply open the box, unfold mattress, and the mattress will expand to its original shape within 72 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91amsTY9P+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHITA","source_asin":"B0953FK9DL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0953FK9DL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0953FK9DL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
