window.products.push({"id":279820,"name":"TANSUNG Poultry Shears, Come-apart Kitchen Scissors, Anti-rust Heavy Duty Kitchen Shears with Soft Grip Handles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718eDpNCCtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MULTIPURPOSE EFFICIENCY BOOSTER】- The multi-functional kitchen shears improve your food prep efficiency by saving time to shift back and forth among different tools. They are not only good at cutting bones and raw meat, scraping fish scales, chopping up herbs and veges, but also peeling fruits and opening bottles. TIP: Please WIPE IT DRY after using and after cleaning to prevent rust and place it in the DRY CONDITIONS. 【HI-TECH PRODUCTION】- The shears made by CNC technology represent premium quality and delicate aesthetics. Crafted from 5Cr15MoV stainless steel widely used in making high quality chef knives, the blades become sharper and resistant to rusting and corrosion. TIP: Please do not immerse the scissors into the water completely. 【HEAVY DUTY KITCHEN TRANSFORMER】- The 3-mode lock design empowers your heavy duty shears under different situations. On locking mode, safety is maximized maximized by preventing the shears from opening accidentally. While doing heavy duty cutting jobs, spring loaded mode relieve the pressure from your hand. For thorough and safe cleaning in dishwashers, detaching mode allows you to safely separate them with ease. ADVICE: Sharpen it or oil it after every 2-3 weeks to keep sharp. 【COMFORTABLY STYLISH】- The shears and the package are both unique inside-out. Larger size of grips with meticulously stylish pattern surrounded, not only offer larger room for your fingers to rest when holding, but also a visual feast. From outside, the package is also well-designed, so the product is your GIFT of choice under many situations.Any problems during use, please contact us in time, we will give you a good solution. 【LIFETIME WARRANTY & 100% MONEY BACK SERVICE】- We strive to create the products that MAKE U SMILE, so if we cannot satisfy your needs for ANY reason, feel free to let us know and simply return it for a replacement one or refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718eDpNCCtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TANSUNG","source_asin":"B08D6DVWTD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D6DVWTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D6DVWTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
