window.products.push({"id":279839,"name":"Modus Furniture Atria Nightstand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ccax5AvLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Atria Nightstand features full extension ball bearing drawer glides and tongue and groove drawer joints. Constructed from Sheesham and Acacia solid wood. Natural Sheesham finish showcases the wood's natural variations in knots, grain, texture and color. The piece is crafted from full-length planks of solid lumber. There are no finger joints or engineered wood. Quality construction ensures the piece to be long lasting. Satin Nickel drawer pulls add a contemporary touch. Drawer boxes and wood frames are corner blocked to ensure rigidity and lasting quality. The Atria bedroom collection is a testament to the beauty of handcraftsmanship. Thick planks of solid lumber are hewn and planted by skilled artisans, then hand-sanded and hand-finished to create furniture that is truly built to last. Every piece of the Atria collection is one of a kind with a different and distinctively beautiful plain sawn grain pattern that radiates a refreshing contrast between heartwood and sapwood, shaped over time by the forces of nature.  Also known as Indian rosewood, Sheesham is an extremely dense hardwood, sourced from sustainable, government managed plantations. The Atria bedroom uses clean, linear styling, lightly finished to showcase the wood's natural variations in knots, grain, texture and color.  The platform bed is outfitted with a large, framed headboard panel and a wide platform base to match the natural weight of the lumber. Subtle differences in the rosy wood grain will pick up matching white and brown tones throughout your bedroom. Crafted entirely from solid lumber, the Atria bedroom uses an all-Sheesham exterior with Acacia drawer boxes and mattress support system.  Drawers are mounted on full extension, ball bearing glides for smooth, efficient operation.  With its premium materials, timeless design and quality craftsmanship, the Atria bedroom is a product that will last for generations. Package includes 1 Atria Nightstand. No assembly required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ccax5AvLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modus Furniture","source_asin":"B005ER6AIK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279839","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005ER6AIK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005ER6AIK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
