window.products.push({"id":279863,"name":"ENOKING 6PCS Knife Set with block, Magnetic Wood Knife Holder with Acrylic Shield, German High Carbon Stainless Steel Blades","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZldKpgWWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FREE SET of KNIVES - Purchase double-sided magnetic knife holder to give a set of knives, including 8” Chef Knife, 8” Slicing Knife, 7” Santoku Knife, 8” Bread Knife, 4.5” Utility Knife. Limited quantity Grab it now! All-In-One Valuable Set For All Cutting Needs. STYLISH SPACE-SAVING DESIGN - A double-sided magnetic design can easily hold up to 12 knives, with additional storage on the back to hold your cutting board. Knives are easily accessible when you need them, there is no need to rummage in drawers looking for knives. ENOKING knife display magnetic not only can keep your kitchen countertop neat and organized but also showcase your knife collection, beautiful and elegant. POWERFUL DOUBLE-SIDED MAGNETIC DESIGN - Built-in multiple enhanced black magnetic stripes, wide-coverage, strong adsorption to secure the knife blades securely in place, even if cutlery widgets, no need to worry about falling off. Also suitable for common household kitchen knives and other metal kitchen tools (steak knife, chef knife, scissors, sharpener). PROTECTIVE ACRYLIC SHIELD & ANTI-SLIP FEET - Transparent acrylic protection eliminates potential injuries caused by sharp knife blades, essential for families with children or pets. The anti-slip base design makes the tool placement more arbitrary and stable, and no need to worry about slipping or shaking. The acrylic shield can be disassembled when you do not need it. MADE of NATURAL HIGH-QUALITY ACACIA WOOD - Durable & sturdy with a beautiful pattern texture that complements any kitchen. Unlike a magnetic knife strip bar or in-drawer bamboo knife block, wooden knife rack prevents knives from getting dull, as they prevent unnecessary friction with other metals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZldKpgWWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ENOKING","source_asin":"B0BW43GNVS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-279863","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW43GNVS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW43GNVS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
